{"id":"filet","lemma":"filet","pos":"noun","rank":3412,"glosses":["trickle, drizzle (of liquid etc.), wisp (of smoke)","fillet, filet (of meat)","frenulum, frenum"],"ipa":"/fi.lɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/Fr-filet.ogg/Fr-filet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"filets"},"formAudio":{"filets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-filets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le filet est énorme.","en":"The net is huge.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"enormous, huge"}]},{"text":"Le ballon est allé au fond des filets.","en":"The ball went in the net.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ball"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"deep down, in the end"]]},{"text":"Il répara le filet.","en":"He fixed the net.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend","l":"réparer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai attrapé des papillons avec un filet.","en":"I captured butterflies with a net.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2710","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to trap","l":"attraper"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"butterfly","l":"papillon"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Les filets étaient chargés de poissons.","en":"The nets were loaded with fish.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"busy","l":"chargé"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"fish","l":"poisson"}]}]}